{"headword":"מַחֲנֶה","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 33:8\" href=\"/Genesis.33.8\">Gn 33:8</a> + 16 times and <strong>f.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 27:3\" href=\"/Psalms.27.3\">ψ 27:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:15\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.15\">1 Ch 11:15</a> (on <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:9\" href=\"/Genesis.32.9\">Gn 32:9a</a> v. Di) encampment, camp—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:9\" href=\"/Genesis.32.9\">Gn 32:9</a><sup>(×2)</sup> + 126 times (incl. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 1:24\" href=\"/Ezekiel.1.24\">Ez 1:24</a>, del. Co); cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲנֵה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:3\" href=\"/Genesis.32.3\">Gn 32:3</a> + 56 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲנֵהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 1:52\" href=\"/Numbers.1.52\">Nu 1:52</a> + 5 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲנֶיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 23:15\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.23.15\">Dt 23:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 29:10\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.29.10\">29:10</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲנֶךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 23:15\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.23.15\">Dt 23:15</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲנֵיכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 4:10\" href=\"/Amos.4.10\">Am 4:10</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲנֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 5:3\" href=\"/Numbers.5.3\">Nu 5:3</a> <a data-ref=\"Judges 8:10\" href=\"/Judges.8.10\">Ju 8:10</a> (cf. infr., and on form of noun c. sf. vid. Ges<sup>§ 93, 3, R 3</sup>); pl. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲנוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:8\" href=\"/Genesis.32.8\">Gn 32:8</a> + 9 times; cstr. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:18\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.18\">1 Ch 9:18</a> + 2 times, <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲנִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:19\" href=\"/Numbers.13.19\">Nu 13:19</a>; sf. (appar. pl. n.) <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲנֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:4\" href=\"/Joshua.10.4\">Jos 10:4</a> + 5 times;—on du. v. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <strong>n.pr.</strong> infr."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>camp, place of encampment:</em>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"of caravan of travellers <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:22\" href=\"/Genesis.32.22\">Gn 32:22</a> (J), especially of Isr. at Exod. and in wildern. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 16:13\" href=\"/Exodus.16.13\">Ex 16:13</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 19:16\" href=\"/Exodus.19.16\">19:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 19:17\" href=\"/Exodus.19.17\">17</a> (all P; disting. from <span dir=\"rtl\">עַם</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁעַר מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 32:26\" href=\"/Exodus.32.26\">Ex 32:26</a> (JE); especially <span dir=\"rtl\">מִחוּץ המ׳</span> in connexion with uncleanness, etc., <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:14\" href=\"/Exodus.29.14\">Ex 29:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 4:12\" href=\"/Leviticus.4.12\">Lv 4:12</a> (P) + often, of position of tent of meeting <a data-ref=\"Exodus 33:7\" href=\"/Exodus.33.7\">Ex 33:7</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (JE), contr. <a data-ref=\"Numbers 2:17\" href=\"/Numbers.2.17\">Nu 2:17</a> (P), where of encampments of several tribes, cf. <a data-ref=\"Numbers 1:52\" href=\"/Numbers.1.52\">1:52</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 2:3\" href=\"/Numbers.2.3\">2:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 10:2\" href=\"/Numbers.10.2\">10:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 10:5\" href=\"/Numbers.10.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 10:6\" href=\"/Numbers.10.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 10:25\" href=\"/Numbers.10.25\">25</a> etc., (all P), already passing over to <strong>3</strong> (cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַחֹנִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 10:5\" href=\"/Numbers.10.5\">10:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 10:6\" href=\"/Numbers.10.6\">6</a>);"}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"specif. of <em>camp of Levites</em>, surrounding tabernacle, so that P can say <span dir=\"rtl\">אֹהֶל־מוֹעֵד מַחֲנֵה הַלְוִיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 2:17\" href=\"/Numbers.2.17\">Nu 2:17</a>; and so (late) of temple <span dir=\"rtl\">הַשֹּׁעֲרִים לְמַחֲנוֹת בְּנֵי לֵוִי</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:18\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.18\">1 Ch 9:18</a>, as well as <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁעֲרֵי מַחֲנוֹת י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 31:2\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.31.2\">2 Ch 31:2</a>; pl. (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִבְצָרִים</span> = <em>fortresses</em>) <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:19\" href=\"/Numbers.13.19\">Nu 13:19</a>."}],"num":"b."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>camp of armed host</em> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 6:11\" href=\"/Joshua.6.11\">Jos 6:11</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 6:14\" href=\"/Joshua.6.14\">14</a> (JE), <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 4:3\" href=\"/I_Samuel.4.3\">1 S 4:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 4:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.4.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 4:6\" href=\"/I_Samuel.4.6\">6</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 4:7\" href=\"/I_Samuel.4.7\">7</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:53\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.53\">17:53</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 7:16\" href=\"/II_Kings.7.16\">2 K 7:16</a> etc."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>those who encamp</em> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 10:5\" href=\"/Numbers.10.5\">Nu 10:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 10:6\" href=\"/Numbers.10.6\">6</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.5\">1 Ch 11:5</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 27:3\" href=\"/Psalms.27.3\">ψ 27:3</a> (all c. vb. <span dir=\"rtl\">חנה</span>), cf. (prob.) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 37:36\" href=\"/Isaiah.37.36\">Is 37:36</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Kings 19:35\" href=\"/II_Kings.19.35\">2 K 19:35</a>, etc."}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>company, body of people;</em> people and beasts <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:8\" href=\"/Genesis.32.8\">Gn 32:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:9\" href=\"/Genesis.32.9\">9</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:11\" href=\"/Genesis.32.11\">11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 33:8\" href=\"/Genesis.33.8\">33:8</a>, funeral company of Jacob <a data-ref=\"Genesis 50:9\" href=\"/Genesis.50.9\">Gn 50:9</a>; of Isr. on march <a data-ref=\"Exodus 14:19\" href=\"/Exodus.14.19\">Ex 14:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 14:20\" href=\"/Exodus.14.20\">20</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Numbers 10:5\" href=\"/Numbers.10.5\">Nu 10:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 10:6\" href=\"/Numbers.10.6\">6</a>."}],"num":"b."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>army, host</em> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:13\" href=\"/Joshua.8.13\">Jos 8:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:5\" href=\"/Joshua.10.5\">10:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 11:4\" href=\"/Joshua.11.4\">11:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:15\" href=\"/Judges.4.15\">Ju 4:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:16\" href=\"/Judges.4.16\">16</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Judges 7:1\" href=\"/Judges.7.1\">7:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 7:8\" href=\"/Judges.7.8\">8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 8:10\" href=\"/Judges.8.10\">8:10</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 8:11\" href=\"/Judges.8.11\">11</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Judges 8:12\" href=\"/Judges.8.12\">12</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:1\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.1\">1 S 17:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:46\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.46\">46</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 3:9\" href=\"/II_Kings.3.9\">2 K 3:9</a> even while in the thick of the fight; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 22:34\" href=\"/I_Kings.22.34\">1 K 22:34</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 18:33\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.18.33\">2 Ch 18:33</a> etc."}],"num":"c."}],"num":"3."}]},"rid":"BDB03244","strong_numbers":["4264"],"next_hw":"מַחֲנֵה־דָ֑ן","prev_hw":"חֲנִית","occurrences":"214","quotes":[],"GK":["4722"],"TWOT":["690c"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}